    "description": "<p>Instruments are a step up from simple <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Probes\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Probes\">Probes</a>. They might be designed to accomplish specific tasks. For example, a Droid with a hypodermic syringe as its sole Appendage can use the syringe for its intended purpose, but otherwise can only push objects with it.</p><p>A few Instruments are designed to clamp, and can thus hold objects, but they are generally delicate. A Droid using an instrument of this nature has a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Carrying_Capacity\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Carrying Capacity\">Carrying Capacity</a> as if its <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Strength\" title=\"Strength\">Strength</a> score were one-quarter of its actual value.</p>",
